  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0: GroupBy & Aggregations - Added full GroupBy() support with aggregate functions. New IGroupByQueryBuilder<TSource, TKey> and IGroupByProjectionQueryBuilder<TResult> interfaces. Supports Count(), Sum(), Average(), Min(), Max() with complex expressions like Sum(p => p.Price * p.Quantity). AggregateExpressionVisitor translates aggregate expressions to SQL. Full integration with WHERE, ORDER BY, LIMIT clauses. SQL GROUP BY generation with proper aggregate handling. 11 new unit tests + 8 integration tests. Comprehensive documentation and examples. Fully backward compatible.",
